  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Experience explosive energy and unmatched comfort with the ASICS Novablast 5. Featuring tongue wing construction, these shoes maximize stretch for a better fit and minimize tongue movement for superior comfort. The Flyte Foam Blast Max cushioning provides exceptional bounce and energy return, while the Trampoline-inspired outsole ensures responsive rebound for a comfortable run. Constructed with a series of recycled materials and the upper featuring at least 75% recycled content, the ASICS Novablast 5 reflects the brand‚Äôs commitment to zero waste, zero carbon emissions, and a greener future.</p> <p><strong>ASICS Novablast 5 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper ensures maximum airflow</li> <li>Reflective details enable visibility in low-light settings.</li> <li>AHAR LO rubber outsole offers traction, improved softness, and advanced durability.</li> <li>Weight: 7.7 oz.</li> </ul> <p>*Sockliner is crafted using a solution dyeing process that cuts water usage by 33% and carbon emissions by 45% compared to traditional methods.</p><hr /><p>From easy miles to long-run days, the ASICS Novablast 5 helps keep every stride soft, lively, and smooth. This women‚Äôs running shoe pairs a breathable engineered mesh upper with a high-stack, energetic feel, so it is equally ready for training sessions, recovery days, and all-day wear.</p><ul><li>FF BLAST MAX cushioning delivers soft landings and responsive bounce</li><li>Tongue wing construction helps create a secure fit and reduces tongue movement</li><li>Trampoline-inspired outsole and AHAR LO rubber support grip, rebound, and durability</li><li>Reflective details help improve low-light visibility</li><li>Upper features at least 75% recycled content</li><li>Approximate weight: 7.7 oz.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers say the fit feels true to size with a comfortable toe box and accommodating shape. For the best fit, we recommend your usual size for a secure feel, or going up a half-size if you prefer a little extra room for longer runs; runners with narrow feet may want to tighten the laces for a more locked-in fit.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for daily training, long runs, walking, and anyone who wants plush cushioning with a lively, lightweight feel.</p>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p> <p>Reviewers consistently praise the plush, bouncy ride, often describing the underfoot feel as cloud-like without feeling bulky. The result is a smooth, springy road shoe that cushions everyday mileage while still keeping transitions energetic.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p> <p>Many runners say the Novablast 5 feels comfortable right out of the box and needs very little break-in before regular use. Long-run users also note that it holds its cushioning well through steady training mileage, making it a dependable option for frequent wear.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® Novablast 5 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Carrier Grey</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1012B765-002</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official ASICS® shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 39.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 4.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.1</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>In Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-a